{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "684da5bd-c0d2-8900-a00c-e3684cfe94e7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T12:31:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:27:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [pause] Is this... the trash people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. Trash and recycling, Public Works. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm Angela. Angela Santoro. [pause] I have a shop. And my pickup... I don't understand it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Angela, no problem. What's confusing about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They said... the schedule changed. After the holiday week. [pause] I want the new schedule. I don't know which day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What's the address for the shop? I'll look up the route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401 Broadway. [pause] In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one Broadway, got it. Let me write that down. Four-oh-one Broadway, North End, asking about the schedule after the holidays. Hang on a sec while I pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Take your time. [pause] Kevin, have you had lunch yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:28:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. Soon, though. It's about twelve thirty, so I'm getting there. Have you eaten?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:29:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] Not yet. I wait for the trash first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:29:10-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Okay, so for that stretch of Broadway, the holiday week pushed things back a day. Now, that should be done and you'd be back to your regular day. Was your regular day Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:29:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday. [pause] I think Tuesday. Or Thursday. The recycling is different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, trash and recycling can be on different days, or alternate weeks. Let me look. So I'm showing trash as the one that shifted, and recycling is every other week on the same route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every other. [pause] I don't understand. Which week is this week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I'll tell you what I see on my screen, but honestly the way it shows the alternating weeks is clunky. So I don't want to just read it wrong and have your bin sitting out for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] I put it out last week. Nobody took it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that tells me something. Was that the week right after New Year's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think so. [pause] Yes. After."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so it may have been the off week for recycling. Here's what I'll do. I'll note your trash day, and I'll have my supervisor call you with the exact recycling weeks so you're not guessing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] I want a supervisor. To call me back. Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. What's the best number? I have one on the screen but I'd rather confirm it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-oh. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's right. [pause] Is it a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says cell, yeah. So they'll call that. If you miss them, they'll leave a message. Anything else on the schedule you wanted to ask about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] Just, which day. And which week. I get mixed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what the callback is for. I've got it written: Angela Santoro, 401 Broadway, needs her trash day confirmed and the recycling weeks explained, supervisor to call back at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. [pause] Go eat lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will, thanks. You do the same, Angela. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bye bye."
    }
  ],
